  "description": "This package contains a HTTP requests client library enabling the desktop report viewer controls to utilize a remote reports generation engine (either reports generation service or Telerik Report Server).\n            This package is part of the Progress® Telerik® Reporting solution.\n            It is used as a complementary package to the Telrik.ReportViewer.WinForms and Telerik.ReportViewer.Wpf NuGet packages. Please find more information in these packages' description.\n            Upgrading the project to a newer NuGet package version will upgrade the runtime libraries but for type report definitions (definitions created with the Visual Studio integrated Report Designer) you must run the Telerik Reporting Upgrade Wizard tool. The tool is part of the full product installer as well.",
